{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "_note": "类型层（Object Types）：只声明对象是什么——主键、kind(entity 实体型/event 事件型)、身份属性、带值类型的属性集。数据来源/清洗/物化 SQL 一律在 bindings.json。值类型：string/integer/decimal/date/boolean。",
  "objects": [
    {
      "name": "person",
      "title": "自然人",
      "pk": "person_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "person_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "person"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "raw_name",
      "properties": {
        "raw_name": "string",
        "id_card": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "org",
      "title": "组织",
      "pk": "org_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "org_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "org"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "raw_name",
      "properties": {
        "raw_name": "string",
        "legal_rep": "string",
        "status": "string",
        "relation": "string",
        "credit_code": {
          "data_element": "DE_CREDIT_CODE"
        }
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "status"
      ],
      "_note": "R15/D10：新增统一社会信用代码。org 不声明 identity_key——静态复合键无法表达\"有码按码、无码按名\"：写 [\"raw_name\",\"credit_code\"] 会让更名主体（同码不同名）被误分列；只写 [\"credit_code\"] 会让当前无码数据全部坍缩为一个实体（更严重）。条件判定在 core/entity_ref.py 实现。"
    },
    {
      "name": "account",
      "title": "账户",
      "pk": "account_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "account_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "account"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "raw_name",
      "properties": {
        "raw_name": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "person_identity",
      "title": "人员信息",
      "pk": "identity_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "identity_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "identity"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "raw_name",
      "_note": "数据接入全流程演示对象：人员建档信息承载 5 个数据元落点（DE_IDCARD/DE_PHONE/DE_GENDER/DE_ID_TYPE/DE_CASE_TYPE；金额/日期/币种落点在 transaction）。源表「人员信息」缺失时 binding optional 跳过；身份证 clean_rule(despace)/手机(strip_cc+digits_only) 经 prop_de_clean 在 py 层自动挂接。",
      "properties": {
        "raw_name": "string",
        "id_card": {
          "data_element": "DE_IDCARD"
        },
        "phone": {
          "data_element": "DE_PHONE"
        },
        "gender": {
          "data_element": "DE_GENDER"
        },
        "id_type": {
          "data_element": "DE_ID_TYPE"
        },
        "case_type": {
          "data_element": "DE_CASE_TYPE"
        }
      },
      "identity_key": [
        "raw_name",
        "id_card"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "transaction",
      "title": "交易",
      "pk": "txn_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "txn_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "txn"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "from_raw",
      "properties": {
        "from_raw": "string",
        "to_raw": "string",
        "amount": {
          "type": "decimal",
          "data_element": "DE_AMOUNT"
        },
        "currency": {
          "data_element": "DE_CURRENCY"
        },
        "date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "call",
      "title": "通话",
      "pk": "call_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "call_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "call"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "caller_raw",
      "properties": {
        "caller_raw": "string",
        "callee_raw": "string",
        "date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "times": "integer"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "trackpoint",
      "title": "轨迹点",
      "pk": "track_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "track_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "track"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "person_raw",
      "properties": {
        "person_raw": "string",
        "location": "string",
        "date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATETIME"
        }
      },
      "_note_time": "date 与 timestamp 并存：date 为日期级事实（DE_DATE，现有规则/链接表 date_diff 口径不变），timestamp 为带时刻的升级字段（DE_DATETIME，可空）。**无时刻时 timestamp 留 NULL，不得补 00:00:00 伪装时刻**——否则日期级判据会伪装成时刻级判据（「两人同时同地」的伪精确）。判「是否可同时」须读 time_precision（由值派生、可被接入层覆盖），而非仅看类型。"
    },
    {
      "name": "location",
      "title": "地点",
      "pk": "location_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "location_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "loc"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "std_address",
      "_note": "维度实体：从事件反向物化，非新数据源。坐标挂实体不挂事件（同源事件共享坐标）；代理键按 std_address 值分配——同标准地址天然归并为同一节点。坐标统一 GCJ-02。",
      "properties": {
        "std_address": "string",
        "raw_address": "string",
        "province": "string",
        "prefecture": "string",
        "county": "string",
        "township": "string",
        "admin_code": "string",
        "lat": "decimal",
        "lng": "decimal",
        "coord_sys": "string",
        "geocode_source": "string",
        "geocode_confidence": "decimal",
        "geocoded_at": "string"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "geocode_source",
        "geocode_confidence",
        "geocoded_at"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "item",
      "title": "重点物品",
      "pk": "item_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "item_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "item"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "title",
      "properties": {
        "item_type": {
          "data_element": "DE_ITEM_TYPE"
        },
        "title": "string",
        "identifiers": "json",
        "primary_digest": "string",
        "descriptors": "json",
        "location": "string",
        "lat": "decimal",
        "lng": "decimal",
        "track": "json"
      },
      "identity_key": [
        "item_type",
        "primary_digest"
      ],
      "_note": "R1/D1 统一 item + item_type 子分类；R3 identifiers 为 json（多标识符，仅存 digest 不落明文，R14）；R6 复合身份键 [item_type, primary_digest]——无凭证类（D4）primary_digest 取 descriptors 摘要，天然各成实体，不静默合并。track 为物品轨迹点 json（R6：独立序列化属性，不并入 trackpoint——person_raw 是人）。持有是**多段时态关系**，归 holds 链接 + hold_record 事件对象，不在物品上挂单值属性（单值会把『甲卖给乙』压成『最后持有人』）。数据源：scripts/prep_item_registry.py 预装配的 物品登记.parquet。",
      "enum_values": {
        "item_type": [
          "vehicle",
          "realestate",
          "invoice",
          "drug_batch",
          "device",
          "portable",
          "goods_other"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hold_record",
      "title": "物品持有登记",
      "pk": "hold_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "hold_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "hold"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "holder_raw",
      "properties": {
        "holder_raw": "string",
        "item_title": "string",
        "item_type": {
          "data_element": "DE_ITEM_TYPE"
        },
        "primary_digest": "string",
        "start_date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "end_date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "start_time": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATETIME"
        },
        "end_time": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATETIME"
        },
        "reg_order": "integer"
      },
      "enum_values": {
        "item_type": [
          "vehicle",
          "realestate",
          "invoice",
          "drug_batch",
          "device",
          "portable",
          "goods_other"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "持有流水事件（一次持有一行），lnk_holds 时态边的物化载体。关联键 (item_type, primary_digest)——R14 不落凭证明文。日期/时刻双列分流与 trackpoint 同口径：纯日期落 start_date/end_date（DE_DATE），含时刻落 start_time/end_time（DE_DATETIME），**缺失留 NULL 不填哨兵、无时刻不补 00:00:00**（R5：起止皆空=区间不可判定，由 hold_chain 落 unknown_overlaps）。reg_order 是台账登记序号，错序（登记序与时间序矛盾）是倒签信号，只标记不重排。",
      "_note_time": "套牌/共用判定依赖时刻级记录：同一车牌同一时段被两人分别使用是信号不是噪声。判『是否同时』须读 time_precision（由值派生），date 档只判同一天先后、不得声称重叠。"
    },
    {
      "name": "bid_project",
      "title": "招投标项目",
      "pk": "project_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "project_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "project"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "title",
      "properties": {
        "title": "string",
        "winner_raw": "string",
        "pub_date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "leader": "string"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "title"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "clue",
      "title": "线索",
      "pk": "clue_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "clue_id",
        "strategy": "natural"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "clue_id",
      "_note_naming": "name_property 等于 pk（自引用）：线索无自然名，代理键即标识",
      "properties": {
        "status": "string",
        "last_operator": "string",
        "note": "string",
        "updated_at": "string"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "status",
        "last_operator",
        "note",
        "updated_at"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "decision",
      "title": "处置决定",
      "pk": "decision_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "decision_id",
        "strategy": "natural"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "decision_id",
      "runtime": true,
      "_note": "运行期对象：不由编译器从 L2 物化。属性声明即 DDL——Action 执行器 file 动作时由 ensure_runtime_tables 建表（obj_decision / lnk_decision_for），列序与 INSERT 对齐。",
      "properties": {
        "decision_type": "enum",
        "clue_id": "string",
        "legal_basis": "string",
        "operator": "string",
        "note": "string",
        "created_at": "string",
        "metadata": "json"
      },
      "enum_values": {
        "decision_type": [
          "立案",
          "不予立案",
          "移送管辖",
          "补充侦查",
          "撤销"
        ]
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "decision_type",
        "clue_id",
        "legal_basis",
        "operator",
        "note",
        "created_at",
        "metadata"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "tipoff",
      "title": "举报线索（内间）",
      "pk": "tipoff_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "tipoff_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "tipoff"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "title",
      "_note": "五间映射：内间（内部线索/举报材料）。五间由 packs/wujian 提供。",
      "properties": {
        "title": "string",
        "submit_date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "target_raw": "string",
        "reporter_raw": "string",
        "content_raw": "string"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "title",
        "submit_date",
        "content_raw"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "osint_article",
      "title": "公开OSINT文章（死间）",
      "pk": "article_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "article_id",
        "strategy": "proxy",
        "prefix": "article"
      },
      "kind": "event",
      "name_property": "raw_name",
      "_note": "五间映射：死间（公开OSINT交叉验证）。五间由 packs/wujian 提供。",
      "properties": {
        "raw_name": "string",
        "info_text": "string",
        "pub_date": {
          "data_element": "DE_DATE"
        },
        "source_name": "string",
        "crawled_at": "timestamp",
        "retention_days": "duration_days"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "info_text",
        "pub_date",
        "source_name",
        "crawled_at",
        "retention_days"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "image_evidence",
      "title": "图像证据（人验通过）",
      "pk": "image_evidence_id",
      "key": {
        "column": "image_evidence_id",
        "strategy": "natural"
      },
      "kind": "entity",
      "name_property": "image_evidence_id",
      "runtime": true,
      "_note": "P8 运行期对象：不由编译器从 L2 物化。VLM 草案永远不直接产生本对象——仅经人验 Action（verify_image）由 ActionExecutor 创建；模型名/prompt 版本/模型分为独立字段（模型分不参与确定性计分，仅供排序参考）。挂主体经 lnk_image_for_person/org/bid_project（按 subject_type 写对应表）。列定义即 DDL，ensure_runtime_tables 建表。",
      "properties": {
        "image_uri": "string",
        "model": "string",
        "prompt_version": "string",
        "model_score": "decimal",
        "title": "string",
        "detail": "string",
        "severity": "string",
        "verifier": "string",
        "verify_conclusion": "string",
        "subject_type": "string",
        "draft_id": "string",
        "created_at": "string"
      },
      "metadata_props": [
        "image_uri",
        "model",
        "prompt_version",
        "model_score",
        "title",
        "detail",
        "severity",
        "verifier",
        "verify_conclusion",
        "subject_type",
        "draft_id",
        "created_at"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
